    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2015-girardia-15: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.37";
    dc:description "The hypothesis has a clear predictive test, but the required voltage movies paired with later morphology were identified as missing. Static images cannot adjudicate a claim specifically about temporal encoding.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Acquire cell-resolved voltage movies through regeneration and test whether temporal features predict final head class better out of sample than static voltage maps. Failure of temporal models to outperform static and non-bioelectric predictors would refute the proposal.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Longitudinal voltage imaging in living planaria is technically difficult.", "The paper explicitly reports no cell-resolution spatiotemporal voltage dataset.";
